From fa116127e28ce4831e93e2cfed9150d114e89fa0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:57:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applet: sort devices by when they were last used

Paired devices were always listed by name, so daily headphones could sit
below devices unused for months. The daemon now records when each device
was last connected, and the applet and KCM list recent ones first.

BUG: 489245
---
 CMakeLists.txt                   |  1 +
 src/applet/CMakeLists.txt        |  1 +
 src/applet/devicesproxymodel.cpp | 34 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/applet/devicesproxymodel.h   |  5 +++++
 src/kded/devicemonitor.cpp       | 18 +++++++++++++++++
 src/kded/devicemonitor.h         |  1 +
 6 files changed, 60 insertions(+)

